{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/2013459/block/singleImage/3277166/df/01M87K782884ZSF04BEQVT4K74.jpg?updatedAt=1795551456\"/><figcaption>6.5米高超巨型「末日博士」雕像主題裝置。</figcaption></figure><p>近年Marvel熱潮持續，加上收藏文化興起，超級英雄主題展覽成為不少商場吸客焦點。圍方今年聖誕聯同Hot Toys推出《復仇者聯盟5：末日降臨》主題展，為電影上映預熱。活動焦點為高達6.5米的「末日博士」巨型雕像，以及雷神、雷射眼和石頭人三大英雄1:1原大雕像，成為今個聖誕的熱門打卡位。此外，Hot Toys將首度展出《復仇者聯盟5》1:6珍藏人偶系列，並於期間限定店帶來逾180款新品及電影周邊，吸引Marvel粉絲及收藏愛好者到場朝聖。配合聖誕檔期，圍方亦將舉辦飄雪表演及引入多個新品牌，透過娛樂、購物及餐飲體驗，進一步鞏固區內消閒地標定位。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/2013459/block/singleImage/3277168/df/01M87K7XFPXP6BMWQCDGEBDC7R.jpg?updatedAt=1795551456\"/><figcaption>Hot Toys《復仇者聯盟5》1:6 人偶全球首展。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/2013459/block/singleImage/3277169/df/01M87K8BEX1BTF9FMK30MFG0FK.jpg?updatedAt=1795551456\"/><figcaption>三大英雄原大雕像亮相。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T21:44:38.029650+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":336,"images":3,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T20:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T04:37:12.365385+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T21:37:54.703647+00:00","content_hash":"b81e51a6aa959203d380f7cd7fa03614f8a98d635dde3db0411e8fa6cb107f25","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T21:44:38.029650+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}